<title>USA: Tokheim names John Tomlinson CFO.</title>
<headline>Tokheim names John Tomlinson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokheim Corp said it named John Tomlinson chief financial officer.</p>
<p>He replaces John Negovetich, who was elected president of Tokheim North America operations.</p>
<p>Tomlinson was formerly a consultant.</p>
<p>Tokheim makes gasoline pumps for service stations.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
